# 專案規範：所有文字檔一律 UTF-8 + LF（覆蓋使用者的 core.autocrlf 設定）
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh   text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.jsonc text eol=lf
*.sql  text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf

# 二進位檔
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
